# ── Deliberately COMMITTED, listed here so nobody "tidies" them away ──
#   version.json              single source of the version number
#   ds-meta.json              maintainer contact, read live by the panel
#   dist/  catalog/           generated, but consumers read them straight
#                             from the pinned submodule, so they must be in git
#   tools/ds-setup.cjs        generated, but this IS the artifact developers curl
#   reference/fonts/*.woff2   the real font files, licences alongside
#   reference/icons/*.svg     the Tabler sprite
#   reference/css/_fonts.css  generated (base64 fonts) - required over file://
#   .release/contract.json    the public-surface baseline for contract-check
#   .release/adoption.json    adoption history; ADOPTION.md is its readable form
